c DFA for strings that contain ba as a substring and do not end in ab
c start state is 0, F = {4,6}
g 7 14

n 0 1 1 
n 1 2 1 
n 2 3 1 
n 3 2 2 
n 4 3 2 
n 5 2 3 
n 6 3 3 
e 0 1 label:a
e 0 3 label:b
e 1 1 label:a
e 1 2 label:b
e 2 4 label:a
e 2 3 label:b
e 3 4 label:a
e 3 3 label:b
e 4 4 label:a
e 4 5 label:b
e 5 4 label:a
e 5 6 label:b
e 6 4 label:a
